Proto buffers to star companies projects

protoc --go_out=. --go-grpc_out=. images_service/protos/*
protoc --go_out=. --go-grpc_out=. permissions_service/protos/*
protoc --go_out=. --go-grpc_out=. products_service/protos/*
protoc --go_out=. --go-grpc_out=. transactions_service/protos/*

Be sure to install the protoc-gen-go and protoc-gen-go-grpc plugins
  go install google.golang.org/protobuf/cmd/protoc-gen-go@latest
  go install google.golang.org/grpc/cmd/protoc-gen-go-grpc@latest